  * Auditor — Stage 3 of the Financial Control & Assurance adoption
  * plan. Gives an external auditor their own read-only portal login to
  * review a tenant's Evidence and Control Exceptions directly.
+ *
+ * FIX: added "internalaudit" to allowedDependencies — closes the
+ * confirmed "no internal-audit engine reachable by an external
+ * auditor" gap. This module reads AuditFinding/AuditFindingRepository
+ * directly (read-only, via findSharedForTenant()'s own SHARED-only
+ * filter) rather than through a facade — matches this whole module's
+ * own established pattern of depending directly on evidence/controls
+ * rather than through an intermediary layer.
  */
-@org.springframework.modulith.ApplicationModule(allowedDependencies = {"shared", "evidence", "controls"})
+@org.springframework.modulith.ApplicationModule(allowedDependencies = {"shared", "evidence", "controls", "internalaudit"})
 package za.co.handyflow.platform.auditor;
